<title>UGANDA: SOCCER-UMEME SC BEAT MOULOUDIA 2-0 IN AFRICA CUP WINNERS CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-UMEME SC BEAT MOULOUDIA 2-0 IN AFRICA CUP WINNERS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>KAMPALA 1997-05-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Umeme SC of Uganda beat Mouloudia Oran of Algeria 2-0 (halftime 0-0) in an Africa Cup Winners Cup second round, first leg match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Charles Ogwangi 71, 81.</p>
<p>Attendance: 20,000</p>
</text>
